stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> queued
    queued --> writing : worker starts the request
    writing --> writing : streamed findings preview
    writing --> CheckCitations : structured reply received
    CheckCitations --> complete : every cited note is citable evidence
    CheckCitations --> writing : uncitable IDs, one correction request
    CheckCitations --> Failed : uncitable IDs after the correction
    complete --> [*]
